  "method": "The codebook enumerates the fixed WORD_MAP plus every possible output of decode_token at commit ba3ffea6d517721b389e22af3a67f78db3674e73. Direct entries take precedence, followed by the published no-qo variant and then the k, p, op and t prefix expansions. Entries were expanded from the published finite stem inventory alone. Unknown tokens emit no Italian, matching the reader’s unknown marker. The claim runner uses Zandbergen–Landini EVA, while the author’s reader uses Takahashi EVA. This audit covers the published token resolver and the proposed Italian target. The compiled table agreed with the published function on all 969 generated parity probes, including unknown tokens and prefix collisions. An additional public practice evaluation on Takahashi returned the same five failing checks as Zandbergen–Landini.",
